---
const INSTALL_CMD =
    "curl -fsSL https://gist.githubusercontent.com/harrisonwang/bcbfea9d71510ec300bdbfe9eab8f9bb/raw/sish-install.sh | sudo DOMAIN=example.com ACME_EMAIL=you@example.com CF_Token=xxx TAKEOVER_22=yes bash";
const CONFIRM_CMD = "sudo sish-confirm";
const ADDUSER_CMD = 'sudo sish-adduser alice "ssh-ed25519 AAAA... alice@laptop"';
---

<section id="selfhost">
    <div class="wrap inner">
        <div class="head">
            <div class="eyebrow">SELF-HOST</div>
            <h2>三步，自建同款服务</h2>
            <p class="sub">
                不常用容易忘，完整部署流程记在这里。前置条件：一台有公网 IP 的服务器（Ubuntu/Debian），域名的
                <code>@</code> 和 <code>*</code> 两条 A 记录指向它。
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <span class="num">01</span>
                    <div class="heading">
                        <span class="label">服务器：一键安装</span>
                        <span class="desc">自动接管 22 端口 + 签发泛域名 HTTPS 证书（域名托管在 Cloudflare）</span>
                    </div>
                    <button class="copy" data-copy={INSTALL_CMD} aria-label="复制命令">&#8943;</button>
                </div>
                <div class="code">
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">$ curl -fsSL https://gist.githubusercontent.com/</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">    harrisonwang/bcbfea9d71510ec300bdbfe9eab8f9bb/</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">    raw/sish-install.sh \</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">  | sudo DOMAIN=example.com \</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">    ACME_EMAIL=you@example.com \</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">    CF_Token=xxx TAKEOVER_22=yes bash</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <span class="num">02</span>
                    <div class="heading">
                        <span class="label">服务器：放行端口并确认</span>
                        <span class="desc">10 分钟内未确认会自动回滚，登录不上也不会失联</span>
                    </div>
                    <button class="copy" data-copy={CONFIRM_CMD} aria-label="复制命令">&#8943;</button>
                </div>
                <div class="code">
                    <div class="cl c-dim"># 云安全组放行 22022（管理 SSH 新端口）</div>
                    <div class="cl c-dim"># 新开终端验证能登录：</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">$ ssh -p 22022 ubuntu@服务器IP</div>
                    <div class="cl">&nbsp;</div>
                    <div class="cl c-dim"># 登录成功后，取消自动回滚：</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">$ sudo sish-confirm</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <span class="num">03</span>
                    <div class="heading">
                        <span class="label">添加用户，开始使用</span>
                        <span class="desc">导入公钥即时生效，之后就是上面的快速开始</span>
                    </div>
                    <button class="copy" data-copy={ADDUSER_CMD} aria-label="复制命令">&#8943;</button>
                </div>
                <div class="code">
                    <div class="cl c-dim"># 服务器：导入用户公钥</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">$ sudo sish-adduser alice \</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">    "ssh-ed25519 AAAA... alice@laptop"</div>
                    <div class="cl">&nbsp;</div>
                    <div class="cl c-dim"># 客户端：建隧道</div>
                    <div class="cl c-cmd">$ ssh -R demo:80:127.0.0.1:4321 ssh.example.com</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="note">
            环境变量、HTTPS 证书方式、卸载等完整说明见
            <a href="https://gist.github.com/harrisonwang/bcbfea9d71510ec300bdbfe9eab8f9bb" target="_blank" rel="noopener">安装脚本头部注释 ↗</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    #selfhost {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .inner {
        padding-top: clamp(64px, 7vw, 96px);
        padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 7vw, 96px);
    }
    .head {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin-bottom: 42px;
    }
    .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
    }
    .eyebrow::before {
        width: 28px;
        height: 1px;
        content: "";
        background: currentColor;
    }
    h2 {
        margin-top: 14px;
        font-size: clamp(28px, 2.8vw, 38px);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
        text-wrap: balance;
    }
    .sub {
        margin-top: 14px;
        color: var(--ink-2);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.75;
    }
    .sub code {
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 12.5px;
        color: var(--terracotta-dark);
        background: #f6ece4;
        border: 1px solid #ecd9c9;
        padding: 1px 6px;
        border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .steps {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
        align-items: stretch;
    }
    .step {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        min-width: 0;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 18px;
        background: rgba(255, 254, 251, 0.9);
        border: 1px solid #e5d9c7;
        border-radius: 15px;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(59, 40, 22, 0.035);
        transition:
            transform 0.22s ease,
            border-color 0.22s ease,
            box-shadow 0.22s ease;
    }
    .step:hover {
        z-index: 2;
        border-color: #d5bea5;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(59, 40, 22, 0.08);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
    .step:not(:last-child)::after {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 3;
        top: 50%;
        right: -19px;
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
        content: "→";
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: #a78f74;
        background: #f8f2e7;
        border: 1px solid #dacbb6;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        transform: translateY(-50%);
    }
    .step-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .num {
        flex: none;
        padding-top: 3px;
        color: var(--terracotta);
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .heading {
        display: grid;
        min-width: 0;
        gap: 4px;
        flex: 1;
    }
    .label {
        color: #29241e;
        font-size: 14.5px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .desc {
        color: #7c7367;
        font-size: 11.5px;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .copy {
        flex: none;
        width: 28px;
        height: 26px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border: 1px solid #e0d3bf;
        background: #fbf6ed;
        color: #8a7c68;
        border-radius: 7px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 13px;
        transition:
            background 0.15s,
            color 0.15s;
    }
    .copy:hover {
        background: #f3e9d9;
        color: var(--terracotta-dark);
    }
    .code {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 26px 16px 18px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: auto;
        background:
            linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025), transparent),
            var(--term-bg);
        border: 1px solid #2c2924;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow:
            inset 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
            0 8px 18px rgba(31, 25, 20, 0.12);
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 11.5px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .code::before {
        position: absolute;
        top: 12px;
        left: 14px;
        width: 5px;
        height: 5px;
        content: "";
        background: #665b4d;
        border-radius: 50%;
        box-shadow:
            9px 0 #514c43,
            18px 0 #3e4e37;
    }
    .cl {
        white-space: pre;
    }
    .c-dim {
        color: #8b8472;
    }
    .c-cmd {
        color: #d8d4ca;
    }
    .note {
        margin-top: 18px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--muted);
    }
    .note a {
        color: var(--terracotta-dark);
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e7c9b8;
        transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .note a:hover {
        border-color: var(--terracotta);
    }
    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
        .steps {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .step:not(:last-child)::after {
            top: auto;
            right: 50%;
            bottom: -21px;
            content: "↓";
            transform: translateX(50%);
        }
    }
    @media (max-width: 620px) {
        .inner {
            padding-left: 18px;
            padding-right: 18px;
        }
    }
</style>
